# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/StGiles.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: St. Giles (off Gilwern Extensions)
# Passage originally known as "The Far North West", presumably a reference to
# "The Far North" in Dan-yr-Ogof. The name St. Giles comes from a major street
# in Oxford.
# 
# Survey Grade 5
# 
# Survey conducted on 6 May 95, OUCC.
# Instruments:	Steve Roberts
# Notes:	Chris Densham
# Data entry:	Tim Long

survey stgiles

